#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: grs-security.php
msgid "GRS Security"
msgstr "GRS Security"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#. Author URI of the plugin
#: grs-security.php
msgid "https://grsdigital.it"
msgstr "https://grsdigital.it"

#. Description of the plugin
#: grs-security.php
msgid ""
"Analyzes site security, applies the recommended fixes in one click and "
"protects logins, users and files."
msgstr ""
"Analizza la sicurezza del sito, applica con un clic le correzioni "
"consigliate e protegge login, utenti e file."

#. Author of the plugin
#: grs-security.php
msgid "GRS Digital"
msgstr "GRS Digital"

#: grs-security.php:32
msgid "GRS Security requires PHP 7.4 or higher."
msgstr "GRS Security richiede PHP 7.4 o superiore."

#: includes/admin/class-admin.php:80
msgid ""
"Security analysis, one-click fixes, login protection, two-step verification,"
" firewall and file monitoring."
msgstr ""
"Analisi della sicurezza, correzioni con un clic, protezione del login, "
"verifica in due passaggi, firewall e controllo dei file."

#: includes/admin/class-admin.php:115
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Security"

#: includes/admin/class-admin.php:134
msgid ""
"The security keys will be regenerated and all users, including you, will be "
"logged out. Compatible GRS plugins (such as GRS SMTP) automatically update "
"their encrypted data. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Le chiavi di sicurezza verranno rigenerate e tutti gli utenti, tu compreso, "
"verranno disconnessi. I plugin GRS compatibili (come GRS SMTP) aggiornano "
"automaticamente i propri dati cifrati. Continuare?"

#: includes/admin/class-admin.php:135
msgid "Do you want to undo this fix?"
msgstr "Vuoi annullare questa correzione?"

#: includes/admin/class-admin.php:148 includes/admin/class-pages.php:63
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Impostazioni"

#: includes/admin/class-admin.php:178
msgid "You are not allowed to perform this action."
msgstr "Non hai i permessi per questa azione."

#: includes/admin/class-admin.php:240
msgid "Analysis completed."
msgstr "Analisi completata."

#: includes/admin/class-admin.php:267
msgid "Fix undone."
msgstr "Correzione annullata."

#: includes/admin/class-admin.php:267
msgid "Fix applied."
msgstr "Correzione applicata."

